1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,050
We all hear about foreign actors making it big in Hollywood.
我们都听说过外国演员在好莱坞大获成功的故事。

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:11,580
But many acknowledge that they were shaking in their boots the first time they were waiting for the director to shout: 'Action!'
但许多人承认，当他们第一次等待导演喊“开拍”时，他们紧张得发抖。

3
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:20,620
Spanish actress Penelope Cruz, star of Zoolander 2 and Vanilla Sky, is a respected actress with a Hollywood career.
西班牙女演员佩内洛普·克鲁兹是《超级名模2》和《香草天空》中的明星，是一位备受尊敬的拥有好莱坞职业生涯的女演员。

4
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:28,640
But she hardly spoke any English when she was cast in her first role in an English language movie in 1998.
但她在1998年首次出演英语电影时几乎不会说英语。

5
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:47,205
In a candid interview with the US broadcaster CBS, Penelope admitted: "I would lock myself in the bathroom and cry because I didn't understand what was going on on the set, because I didn't understand everything that the director was saying or what the other actors were saying."
在一次接受美国广播公司CBS的采访时，佩内洛普坦承：“我会把自己锁在浴室里哭，因为我不明白片场发生了什么，因为我不明白导演在说什么，也不明白其他演员在说什么。”

6
00:00:47,205 --> 00:00:51,830
Closer to home we have the example of Ziyi Zhang.
我们更熟悉的例子是章子怡。

7
00:00:51,830 --> 00:01:01,110
She gained international acclaim in Memoirs of a Geisha and Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon and received many nominations for awards.
她因《艺伎回忆录》和《卧虎藏龙》获得国际赞誉，并多次获得奖项提名。

8
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:03,360
What's helped her to learn English?
是什么帮助她学习英语的呢？

9
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:06,840
Well, she says she listened to Eminem songs.
她说她听埃米纳姆的歌。

10
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:12,170
And as she learned the language, she realised "how rude" the lyrics were.
当她掌握了这门语言，她才意识到歌词是“多么粗俗”。

11
00:01:12,170 --> 00:01:20,800
But when it comes to acting in English, nobody has a more colourful story than Austrian Arnold Schwarzenegger.
但一谈到用英语表演，没有人比奥地利人阿诺德·施瓦辛格的故事更丰富多彩了。

12
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:26,810
He had to be dubbed at the beginning of his career because nobody could make out what he was saying.
在他职业生涯的初期，他不得不被配音，因为没有人能理解他在说什么。

13
00:01:26,810 --> 00:01:41,370
In his next film, he played a deaf mute.
在他的下一部电影中，他扮演了一个聋哑人。

14
00:01:41,370 --> 00:02:01,470
Yes - the complicated name, the thick accent, the big body - nothing stopped him from doing the things he liked.
是的——复杂的名字、浓重的口音、庞大的身躯——没有什么能阻止他做自己喜欢的事情。

15
00:02:01,470 --> 00:02:05,130
So don't despair when you struggle with English.
所以，当你在英语学习中遇到挫折时，不要绝望。

16
00:02:05,130 --> 00:02:08,260
They've all been there and they've prevailed.
他们都经历过，并且成功了。

17
00:02:08,260 --> 00:02:11,020
Are you ready for your close up in life?
你准备好迎接你生命中的特写镜头了吗？
